//! VM layer — PRODUCTION CANDIDATE `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.7-kas.sil`
//! (contract `PolicyVaultRootedKas`, generated by `tools/gen_v7_kas.js` as an
//! exact-match delta over the FROZEN `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.4.1.sil`)
//! driven through the real TxScriptEngine (covenants enabled, real Schnorr),
//! together with the PRODUCTION root `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.7-root.sil`.
//!
//! This is the ROOTED KAS SAFE-PAYMENT PROFILE: the SAME byte-level
//! root-successor pinning as `v7_payment_production.rs`
//! (`requireRootAuthorization`, the ROOT_TAIL constants,
//! `requireOnlyRootCovenantInputs`), applied to the frozen v0.4.1 plain-KAS
//! covenant instead of the frozen v0.5 token controller. Every v0.4.1
//! delegate-side rule (per-spend cap, period budget + rollover, recipient
//! Merkle allowlist, vault-level M-of-N approvals above a threshold, agent
//! Merkle set, fee-reserve conservation, exact successor value, pause) is
//! carried byte-for-byte; the root replaces the removed owner key for every
//! owner-side operation (ownerControl selectors 0..6, ownerRecover).
//!
//! `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.4.1.sil` and `contracts/PolicyVault.v0.7-root.sil`
//! are opened READ-ONLY as production baselines; neither is ever modified.

